==============================================================================
[PROVED] det J_W1 = det J_W2 = -2
[PROVED] <W1-(a,b,c)> = <F-(a,b,c-a^2)>:  W1_3-c = (F3-(c-a^2)) + (F1-a)(F1+a)
[PROVED] <W2-(a,b,c)> = <F-(a-bc+c^3, b-c^2, c)>  (two generator identities;
         third generator shared)  => W-fibers are tau-translates of F-fibers
[PROVED] W1: tau o W1 = F; all three cores are tau-pullbacks
   (r-core certificate uses the transformed anchor r = (b o tau) - y);
   L_W1 = L o T^{-1}  (target covariance CONFIRMED);
   disc_X E = -4 (S o tau)^2 L_W1;  disc_R P = -2916 (a o tau)^2 L_W1;
